### Criar draft de página Confluence
POST https://your-domain.atlassian.net/wiki/api/v2/pages
Authorization: Basic {{CONFLUENCE_BASIC_AUTH}}
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": "123456",
  "status": "draft",
  "title": "Exemplo de artigo KB",
  "parentId": "123456",
  "body": {
    "representation": "storage",
    "value": "<h1>Exemplo de artigo KB</h1><p>Conteúdo...</p>"
  }
}
